		<string id="SPELL_DESC_ENRAGE">
			<en>ATTACK WITH A [BOOST]% DAMAGE BOOST AND HEAL [HEAL]% OF YOUR HEALTH</en>
            <ja>攻撃時、敵に[BOOST]%のダメージを与え、\n自身の体力を[HEAL]%回復させます</ja>
            <no>ANGRIP MED EN [BOOST]% SKADEBOOST OG HELE [HELE]% HELSEN DIN</no>
